POST /api/sessions/{id}/mute and GET /outcome?refresh=1 took exclusive_maintenance, which a running
gateway always holds, so ⌘B on a gateway-served profile toasted 'Could not update the parked state:
Exclusive maintenance refused' and rolled back (hub: 33 refusals since 2026-10-30). Route them through
the live owner's own store like owner-backfill. Live-gateway test (RED = 409), plus a hotkey test for
⌘B from the page and from the composer.
